    <headline>Palpa: Kaligandaki corridor one way at Rampur-1 after a landslide</headline>
    <description>Official: Nepal Police list 'main highway obstructions due to disasters', to 7:00 AM Kartik 15 (1 Nov) (@NepalPoliceHQ): the Kaligandaki corridor at Rampur Municipality-1, Palpa, hit by a landslide at 7:00 AM on Kartik 14 (31 Oct), is now open one way at a time.</description>
    <instruction>Traffic one way at a time; expect delays and follow police instructions (100).</instruction>
